  "content": "<p>🛋️ <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>廢棄城市建築</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;</span>- <span style=\"color:#34495e\">末日裝飾附加包</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>英文：</strong></span></p><p>此附加包為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日結構：廢棄城市建築</a>模組添加了來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日裝飾</a>的<strong>裝飾道具</strong>。<br>您的廢墟建築現在將更加身臨其境——添加了<strong>屍體與血跡</strong>。</p><p>使用<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span>構建，因此需要以下模組才能正常運作：</p><p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>必備模組：</strong></span></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日結構：廢棄城市建築</a></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API for Abandoned City Buildings</a></p><p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka Library</a></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日裝飾</a></p><p>💬 加入我們的<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Discord</span>以獲取最新資訊並提出建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">俄文：</span></p><p>此模組為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日結構：廢棄城市建築</a>模組添加了來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日裝飾</a>的<strong>裝飾元素</strong>。<br>現在廢棄建築將更具氛圍感——內部增加了<strong>屍體與血跡</strong>。</p><p>模組使用<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span>開發，因此需要以下附加模組。</p><p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>必備模組：</strong></span></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日結構：廢棄城市建築</a></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API for Abandoned City Buildings</a></p><p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka Library</a></p><p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日裝飾</a></p><p>💬 加入我們的Discord伺服器或Telegram頻道，以追蹤更新、回報錯誤與提出建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
